\p
\v 5 It¦37310 started with the¦37317 priest¦37319 Zekaryah \add !(Zechariah¦37322)\add* and¦37326 his wife¦37328 Elizabeth at the¦37312 time¦37313 when Herod¦37314 was the king¦37316 of¦37318 Yudea¦37318. (Zekaryah was in¦37311 the¦37321 priestly division¦37324 of¦37325 Abiyah, and Elizabeth was also¦37326 a descendant of Aaron¦37334.)\x + \xo 1:5: \xt 1Ch 24:10.\x*
