\v 41 “\wj How come you¦43412 notice the¦43413 speck¦43414 in¦43416 someone else's eye¦43418, yet don't¦43431 even notice the¦43422 log that's¦43425 in your¦43421 own¦43429 eye¦43430?\wj*
