\v 38 She¦44559 stood¦44547 weeping¦44556 behind¦44548 Yeshua's feet¦44551, wetting¦44560 his feet¦44563 with¦44557 her tears¦44558. Then she¦44574 used her hair¦44569 to¦44560 wipe¦44574 off¦44574 the tears and¦44576 kissed¦44577 his feet and \add rubbed\add* the lotion into them¦44574.
