\v 41 \add Then Yeshua told him this story:\add* “\wj Once there¦44645 were¦44645 two¦44643 people who had borrowed from a money¦44646 lender: one¦44649 borrowed five-hundred coins¦44651 and¦44654 the¦44653 other¦44655 borrowed fifty¦44657.\wj*
\v 42 \wj But¦44660 neither of them was¦44673 able to¦44662 repay him, so he¦44664 wrote-off both¦44663 of their¦44667 debts. Now after that¦44665, which¦44665 one of them do you think would¦44673 appreciate him¦44674 more¦44671?\wj*”
