\v 44 Then¦44695 looking at the¦44698 woman¦44699 he¦44703 said¦44703 to¦44702 Simon¦44702, “\wj You¦44704 see¦44704 this¦44705 woman¦44707? I came¦44708 into¦44710 your¦44709 house¦44713 but¦44695 you¦44709 didn't¦44725 give¦44727 me¦44718 any water¦44716 to¦44718 wash my feet¦44722, yet she wet¦44732 my feet¦44735 with¦44731 her tears¦44731 and¦44695 then¦44695 wiped¦44742 them¦44742 off¦44742 with¦44737 her hair¦44738.\wj*
