\p
\v 27 While Yeshua was¦49450 teaching¦49450 these¦49452 things, a¦49455 woman¦49459 in the¦49461 crowd¦49462 shouted¦49450 out, “Blessed¦49465 is¦49465 the¦49466 mother who bore¦49469 you and¦49447 the¦49449 one who raised¦49453 you.”
