\v 29 The¦49496 crowds¦49498 had grown even larger, but¦49497 Yeshua told¦49501 them, “\wj This¦49504 generation¦49503 is¦49507 evil¦49506 because they're requesting a miracle and¦49497 the only¦49517 miracle that¦49504 will be¦49515 given¦49515 to¦49516 them will be the¦49519 miracle¦49520 of¦49521 Yonah¦49521 \+add (Jonah)\+add*.\wj*\x + \xo 11:29: \xt Mrk 8:12; Mat 16:4.\x*
\v 30 \wj In the same way that¦49542 Yonah¦49528 became¦49526 a sign¦49532 to¦49530 the¦49530 \+add citizens\+add* of Ninevah, so¦49533 too the¦49536 son¦49537 of¦49539 humanity¦49539 will¦49534 also¦49535 be¦49534 to¦49541 this¦49542 generation¦49541.\wj*\x + \xo 11:30: \xt Yonah 3:4.\x*
\v 31 \wj The¦49567 queen¦49566 from the south¦49567 will¦49568 come¦49584 back to life on judgement¦49571 \+add day\+add* along with¦49572 the¦49573 people¦49575 from this¦49578 generation¦49577, and¦49579 she'll condemn¦49580 them¦49581, because¦49583 she¦49584 travelled a long distance to¦49590 hear¦49590 Solomon's¦49593 wisdom¦49592, and¦49594 now, someone's¦49596 here¦49598 who's greater¦49596 than¦49596 Solomon¦49597.\wj*\x + \xo 11:31: \xt 1Ki 10:1-10; 2Ch 9:1-12.\x*
\v 32 \wj The¦49604 people of¦49618 Ninevah will¦49602 stand¦49602 up¦49602 on judgement¦49605 \+add day\+add* along with¦49606 the¦49607 people from this¦49609 generation¦49608 and¦49610 they'll¦49611 condemn¦49611 this generation because¦49613 those from Ninevah turned from their disobedience after Yonah's¦49618 preaching, and¦49619 now, someone's¦49621 here¦49624 who's greater¦49621 than¦49621 Yonah¦49623.\wj*\x + \xo 11:32: \xt Yonah 3:5.\x*
\s1 The eye is the body's lamp
