\p
\v 33 “\wj No¦49625 one¦49625 lights¦49645 a lamp¦49627 and then hides¦49630 it somewhere or puts it under¦49634 a basket¦49636, but¦49637 rather they put it on¦49638 a lampstand¦49640 so that¦49641 everyone¦49625 entering¦49643 \+add the room\+add* can see¦49647 the¦49644 light¦49645 \+add from it\+add*.\wj*\x + \xo 11:33: \xt Mrk 4:21; Mat 5:15; Luk 8:16.\x*
\v 34 \wj Your¦49657 eyes are like the¦49651 lamp¦49650 for your body¦49652. Whenever¦49658 your eyes¦49662 are¦49665 healthy¦49664, your \+add entire\+add* body¦49670 will be¦49680 bright¦49672, but¦49677 when¦49676 your eyes are evil¦49679, your body¦49683 is¦49685 also¦49681 dark¦49687,\wj*
\v 35 \wj so take care in case the¦49694 light¦49695 in¦49697 you¦49698 has gone dark¦49699.\wj*
