\p
\v 37 When¦49732 Yeshua \add had a break from\add* speaking¦49734, a member¦49743 of the Pharisee¦49743 party¦49743 invited him¦49740 over for breakfast¦49747, so¦49746 he¦49747 went¦49753 into the house and¦49732 sat¦49755 down¦49755,
\v 38 and¦49757 the¦49756 man was¦49771 very surprised that¦49768 he¦49771 didn't¦49769 observe the handwashing ceremony before¦49773 he ate.
\v 39 But¦49791 the \nd master¦49779\nd* said¦49776 to¦49780 his host, “\wj Yes, all¦49783 of you¦49783 in the¦49784 Pharisee¦49785 party¦49785 clean¦49794 the¦49787 outside¦49788 of¦49789 the¦49789 cup¦49790 and the plate, but¦49777 your¦49799 insides¦49798 are¦49794 full¦49801 of¦49802 theft¦49802 and¦49803 wickedness¦49804.\wj*
