\p
\v 1 By then the¦50159 crowd¦50160 had¦50154 grown to¦50163 many thousands¦50158, so much so that they were¦50163 trampling¦50163 on each other. Meanwhile Yeshua told¦50168 his¦50172 followers¦50171, “\wj \+add ≈Make sure that you're not influenced by the¦50177 hypocrisy¦50183 of¦50172 the¦50179 Pharisee¦50180 party¦50180—it spreads around like yeast in¦50151 bread dough\+add*.\wj*\x + \xo 12:1: \xt Mrk 8:15; Mat 16:6.\x*
\v 2 \wj But¦50197 everything that's covered¦50191 up¦50191 \+add now\+add*, will be¦50196 uncovered \+add in the future\+add*, and¦50197 everything that's \+add now\+add* hidden¦50198 will revealed¦50196.\wj*\x + \xo 12:2: \xt Mrk 4:22; Luk 8:17.\x*
\v 3 \wj Anything that¦50203 you¦50209 \+add whispered\+add* in¦50205 the¦50206 dark¦50207 will¦50214 be¦50214 heard¦50214 in¦50211 the¦50212 light¦50213, and¦50215 anything that was only for certain ears¦50219 in¦50221 a private¦50223 room¦50223 will¦50224 be¦50224 announced¦50224 from the¦50226 rooftops.\wj*
