\p
\v 8 “\wj I'm¦50324 telling¦50324 you¦50326 that everyone¦50328 who¦50329 admits in¦50333 public to following me¦50334, so too the¦50339 son¦50340 of¦50342 humanity¦50342 will¦50343 tell¦50324 their names to¦50326 \nd God's¦50351\nd* messengers¦50349,\wj*
\v 9 \wj but¦50353 anyone who disowns¦50354 me¦50355 in public will¦50361 be¦50361 disowned¦50354 in front¦50357 \+nd of¦50368\+nd* \nd God's¦50368\nd* messengers¦50366.\wj*
