\v 10 “\wj Everyone¦50379 who says¦50373 something against¦50375 the¦50376 son¦50377 of¦50379 humanity will¦50380 be forgiven, but¦50369 those who¦50371 speak against¦50385 the¦50388 holy¦50389 \+nd spirit¦50390\+nd* won't¦50393 be¦50394 forgiven¦50394.\wj*\x + \xo 12:10: \xt Mrk 3:29; Mat 12:32.\x*
