\v 11 “\wj Whenever¦50405 you¦50411 get dragged into the¦50414 \+add ≈Jewish¦50416 meeting¦50416 halls¦50416\+add* or in¦50408 front¦50413 of rulers¦50420 or authorities¦50423, don't¦50426 worry¦50428 about how¦50430 you'll defend¦50433 yourselves or what¦50432 you'll say¦50437,\wj*\x + \xo 12:11-12: \xt Mrk 13:11; Mat 10:19-20; Luk 21:14-15.\x*
\v 12 \wj because¦50439 the¦50438 holy¦50440 \+nd spirit¦50441\+nd* will¦50442 show you¦50444 all¦50444 the right thing to¦50451 say¦50451 at the right time¦50448.\wj*”
